  "instructions": [
    "Cut the cucumber into 3 cm slices and lay them flat on a plate.",
    "In a bowl combine smoked paprika, cumin, salt, pepper, lemon juice, and minced garlic to form a paste.",
    "Spread the paste evenly between each cucumber slice and sprinkle chopped cilantro on top.",
    "Place shredded nori over each slice for extra texture.",
    "Drizzle fermented whey over the cucumber slices.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for 2 hours to allow light fermentation.",
    "After fermentation, transfer the cucumber slices to an airtight container for meal prep.",
    "Store in the refrigerator for up to 3 days.",
    "Serve chilled or at room temperature as a refreshing snack."
